  <para style="h">2 Phethiro</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo Gwebubili gwaPhethiro</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Phethiro</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Pheth</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo Gwebubili</para>
  <para style="mt1">GWAPHETHIRO</para>
  <para style="imt">Tjinginiso</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Lukwalo gwebubili gunobva kuna Phethiro </char> gwakakwagwa ndiMpositoli Phethiro, koga bazibi banjinji bangwenu banokumbula kuti akute lebeswa. Kungabe kuli umwe bo wakakwala akamila Phethiro. Nkwali unoti butjilo gwaYesu wakagubona nemeho awe nehandugwa tjimo kwaYesu wakakubona (2 Phethiro 1.17-18). Hapa kuli Phethiro wakakwala kungabe kuli kuti wakagukwala elikuRoma pakati kwemakole ali makumi matanhatu anamahanu nemakumi ali matanhatu anahhanhalume hule kwezwagwa kwaKhirisitu, Phethiro asanhu akafa. Kakale Phethiro unoguti lukwalo gugwe gwebubili (2 Phethiro 3.1), kunobva kuti lukwalo igogu gwakakwagwa hule kwelukwalo gwaPhethiro wekutanga. Lukwalo igogu wakagukwalila maKhirisitu ose.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phethiro lukwalo igogu wakagukwalila kuludzila bagalimoyo kuti batjile butjilo bubuya kakale ebatjenjedza kuti basitobele badiyi bemanyepwa (2 Phethiro 2). Wakabakuludzila kuti basibe nehanya nebanhu banoti Yesu unotola lubaka gulefu kuti ahanduke. Koga ke unokusa patjena kuti Ndzimu aatononoka koga unohaka kuti banhu bose batjidziwe (2 Phethiro 3.8-9), ndizo nhu wakafanila tjila butjilo bubuya (2 Phethiro 3.14).</para>
  <para style="iot">Nlongoloso Yezwimukati</para>
  <para style="io1">Phethiro unozwitula kakale unolebeleka nebaanokwalila (2 Phethiro 1.1-2).</para>
  <para style="io1">Ekotjibakumbudza kuti batjile butjilo bubuya ngobe Ndzimu wakatiyeta tikatubula gutjila (2 Phethiro 1.3-21).</para>
  <para style="io1">Epamha epa tjenjedzo nekwebadiyi bemanyepwa eleba nekuti kowhoyetikani kubali kubupelo (2 Phethiro 2.1-22).</para>
  <para style="io1">Hule kwayikoko Phethiro unofidza nekukuludzila bagalimoyo kuti batjile butjilo bubuya bebaakanyila hha kwaYesu kwebubili (2 Phethiro 3.1-17).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Kubva kuna Simoni Phethiro, nlanda nempositoli waYesu Khirisitu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Kuna ibabo bakawana bugalimoyo bubuya segwedu ngendulamo yeNdzimu wedu neNtjidzi Yesu Khirisitu.<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Ngoni nekunyalala ngakuwande kumuli ngeziba kwenyu Ndzimu naYesu He wedu.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dana kweNdzimu neHala kukwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Simba lile lakayengemala lakatipa zwinhu zose zwinohakika mubutjilo nezwinohakika kuti tihle Ndzimu, ngewunziba iye wakatidana ngegudzo lile nenaka kukwe, <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />ngezwinhu izwezwi wakatipa zwigadzabgwe zwizwe zwibuya zwikulu kwazo, kuyetila kuti muzwili mutihhe bubi gumubanhu muhango ino gunobva munjemulo, kakale mube negobe mumamo akayengemala. <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Nentha yayikoku gwisani nemasimba ose pamhidzila lulama kubugalimoyo gwenyu, mupamhidzile luzibo pehhugwi kwelulama, <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />mupamhidzile kuzwidziba pehhugwi kweluzibo, mupamhidzile simidzila pehhugwi kweluzibo, kakale mupamhidzile hla Ndzimu pehhugwi kwesimidzila, <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />mupamhidzile whanana nemakamu pehhugwi kwehla Ndzimu, mupamhidzile ludo pehhugwi kwewhanana nemakamu. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Kuti hapa zwinhu izwezwi zwilimumuli nebunji, zowhomuthama kuti musibe simbe kakale mube nebhunduko mukuziba He wedu Yesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Ngobe iye usina zwinhu izwezwi ibhofu unobonela pedlo kakale watjikangan'wa kuti wakatjenesewa mumatjinyo awe antolo.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Ndizo ke, makamu, gwisani lakidza kuti makadan'wa kakale makahalugwa kwelebeswa, ngobe hapa mukuthama ikoku amutowhowa, <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />ndizo mowhobaakanyigwa nkoba nkulunkulu wengina mubumambo gusingapele gwaHe Ntjidzi wedu Yesu Khirisitu.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Ndizo ke ndowhogala ndimukumbudza nekwezwinhu izwezwi, nekene muzwiziba kakale zwakasimisiwa mulebeswa lamunalo. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Ndokumbula kuti kwakalulama, kuti ndibe ndimuzunguza ndimukumbudza, hapa nditjimumbili iwhoyu, <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />saku ndiziba kuti kolomogwa kwembili wangu kwabepedlo, sekwandakalakidziwa ndiHe Yesu Khirisitu wedu. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Ndowhothama kose kwandinotubula kuti hapa ndatjifa musale mukumbula zwinhu izwezwi kene nagupi lubaka.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basupi beGudzo laKhirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Ngobe atizotobela ngano dzakabaakanyiwa nebutjenjebvu patakamuzibisa nekwemasimba kakale nehha kwaHe wedu Yesu Khirisitu, koga takaba basupi bakazwibonela nemeho abo bukulu gugwe. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Ngobe paakalemekedzewa kakale akakudziwa naNdzimu Tate, paakawha whi libva kuGudzo Gulu liti, “Whoyu ndiye Nkololo wangu wandinoda, ndohanha kwazo nekukwe,” <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />whi ileli takaliwha libva kudzimu, ngobe takabe tinaye mudombo lakayengemala.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Kakale tina kugalabgwe kwakapelela mumatama akalebgwa nebalebesambeli. Mowhoba mathama zwakanaka hapa muwhilila matama ihawa abe setjivoneko tjinovoneka muhhalima, kudza kube mahhakuyedza namasasi tjipenya mumimoyo yenyu. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Tjekutanga makafanila kuwhisisa kuti akuna bulebesambeli gwewhalo gwakangobva mukukumbula kwenhu, <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />ngobe akuna bulebesambeli gwakahha ngekuda kwenhu, koga banhu bakabe belebeleka matama anobva kuNdzimu belawugwa neMeya Yakayengemala.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Badiyi Bemanyepwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Koga kwakamuka balebesambeli bemanyepwa pakati kwebanhu, sekwakunowhobe nebadiyi bemanyepwa pakati kwenyu, banowhomuhhisila zwidiyo zwemanyepwa zwinokolomola ngezila yakasumbikala, belandula He wakabawangula, bezwihhisila paladziwa nekulibilidza. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Banjinji banowhotobela zila dzabo dzesazwibhata, nentha yabo zila yelebeswa inowholengudziwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Mupupa kwabo banowhomutshambidzila behingisa matama abo emanyepwa, kubvisila ntolo tongewa kwabo kwakabe kuhinga pakati kwabo, nepaladziwa kwabo kwakabalinda.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Ngobe hapa Ndzimu esakaletja batumwa pabakathama matjinyo, koga akabaposela mumoto akabasa mumimwina imuhhalima bakasungwa kudze kuti batjengetiwe kunoswika hhuba letongewa, <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />hapa asakaletja hango yantolo, koga akalondolodza Nowa, nsumikili wendulamo, anabamwe banhu balikutondeka, paakahhisa nkubila muhango yebanhu bakabe besingahle Ndzimu, <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />hapa kuli kuti wakatonga mizi-mikulu yekuSodoma neGomora ngekuyikolomola ikaba nlota, wakayithama ikabe tjilakidzilo tjekunowhoyetika kuna ibabo basingahle Ndzimu, <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />hapa akawangula Loti, nlume wakalulama, wakabe ewhisiwa zwinogwadza nesazwibhata kwebasina nlayo, <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />(ngobe iwhoyo nlume wakalulama, etjila pakati kwabo, hhuba nehhuba meya iye yakalulama yaka ihhala buyendasi ngentha yemihingo yebasina nlayo yaaka ebona neyaaka ewha), <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />ndizo He unoziba kuti unobatjidza tjini bakalulama mukulikwa, netjengeta basakalulama balimukulangiwa kudza kunoswika hhuba letongewa, <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />bukulu ibabo banotobela njemulo mbi dzetjiba kwembili belengudza tonga kweNdzimu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Banozwiloba fuba kakale banozwibudza, abatohla tuka ibabo banagudzo, <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />koga batumwa bekudzimu, nekene bakasima kakale benasimba kubapinda, abatobapa ntongo wetukana kwabo mbeli kwaHe. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Koga ibaba, semhuka dzisingahingise bulubi, zwibumbgwa zwinoyeta zwisakumbula, dzakazwaligwa kuti dzibhakhwe dzibulawe, banotukana nekwendebo dzabasingawhisise, banowhobulawa bo semhuka, <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />bedziyidzika ngentha yebubi gwabo. Kubali hanha whuthama tjinohanhisa mbili masikati. Pabanoba bedla namwi banoba behanhisiwa zwabo nebupitipiti gwabo, ndizo bemutjinyidzila mazina enyu kakale bemubhatisa honi. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Bana meho ahhele bupombgwe, abatonyala netjinya. Banotungamilila ntome ibabo banameya isakadzikama. Mimoyo yabo yakadiyiwa pupa. Bana bakalongwa bhiso! <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Bakabhuda muzila yakatambunuka bakalahika; bakatjitobela zila yaBhalamu, nkololo waBhowa, waka eda nlipo wethama kusakalulama, <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />koga wakatjemegwa nekakambe ngentha yejinyo lile; kakambe tjisingalebeleke tjakalebeleka ngewhi lenhu tjikamisa bupengo gwenlebesambeli.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Banhu ibaba bakafanana nemisenya isina vula nefulele inotutudziwa nedutu; kubali bakatjengetegwa bugalo muhhalima lakati zwi. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Ngobe, banozwikudza nematama asina nemano ose, banohingisa njemulo mbi dzembili tjebela banhu batjambosubvunuka muna ibabo banotjila butjilo gwetjinya. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Banobagadzabgwe lusununguko, koga ibo tjekwabo balanda bebupitipiti, ngobe nhu unlanda wekene ini tjinowunkulila. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Ngobe hapa kuli kuti hule kwetihha hambgwa dzehango nentha yeziba He Ntjidzi wedu Yesu Khirisitu, bekotjibhakhwa kakale nemisungo ibakulila, kobva kuti mamo ebupelo abo atjiyipa kupinda ekutanga. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Ngobe kobe kwakabe kuhine kubali kadzene bakabe besatongoziba zila yendulamo pana kuti hule kweyiziba befupatile nlayo wakayengemala wabakapiwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Kwakayetika kubali tjinolebgwa nekungulupeswa lelebeswa linoti, “Mbgwa inobgwilila ikanodla mapfo ayo,” nekuti, “Ngulube yangudziwa inobgwilila ikanobumbuluka mudope.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Tjigadzabgwe Tjehha KwaHe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Badikani, igogu lukwalo gwebubili gwandamukwalila, mububili gwadzo ndagwisa mukumbudza kuyetila kuti mube nemikumbulo mibuyanana, <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />kudze mukumbule matama akalebgwa ntolo nebalebesambeli bakayengemala nenlayo waHe neNtjidzi wamakalayiwa ngebapositoli benyu. <verse eid="2PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Tjekutanga makafanila kuwhisisa ikoku, kuti mumahhuba ebupelo kowhoba nebanhu banoba belawugwa nenjemulo dzabo banowhomuseka <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />beti, “Wakatigadzabgwe kuti unohha ngono uponi? Kubvisila lubaka gwakatjinyika bobatategulu bedu, zwinhu zose zoyendilambeli sezwakazwiyendila mbeli kubvisila pakabumbiwa hango.” <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Banokukangan'wa kamwaza ikoku, kuti ngedama leNdzimu kudzimu kwakabeyapo ntolo, nekuti hango yakabumbiwa kubva muvula ibumbiwa nevula, <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />nekuti hango yayigogo lubaka yakakubiwa ikapaladziwa nevula. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Koga ngedama ilo zwalo kudzimu nehango kuyapo ngwenu kwakatjengetegwa moto, kutjengetegwa kuti kudze kunoswika hhuba letongewa nepaladziwa kwebanhu basingahle Ndzimu.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Koga musikangan'we tjinhu tjin'ompela, badikani, kunaHe hhuba lin'ompela lofanana nemakole alitjiwulu, nemakole alitjiwulu anofanana nehhuba lin'ompela. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />He aatononoka thama tjaakagadzabgwe sebamwe bekutola sekuti unononoka, koga una moyonlefu kumuli, esingayemule kuti kube newunopaladziwa, koga kuti wose nhu ahanduke mumatjinyo.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Koga hhuba laHe lowhohha sembava, nekudzimu kowhopinda ngehhoba whulu, nembumbiko yose inowhonyawuka nentha yemoto, nehango nemihingo yose yakayetiwa muyili kowhoba makungutshwa. <verse eid="2PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Sayikoku zwinhu zose izwezwi zowhopaladziwa, ngono imwi makafanila ba banhu bakatini? Makafanila tjila nezila yakayengemala muhla Ndzimu, <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />se makamilila hha kwehhuba leNdzimu mugwisa nemasimba ose kuti lilibilidze. Ngobe muna ilelo hhuba kudzimu kowhotshwa kukapalala, mbumbiko inowhonyawuka nentha yemoto! <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Koga seleba kwetjigadzabgwe tjitje tolinda kudzimu kutshwa nehango ndzwa kunandulamo ko.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Ndizo ke, badikani, sayikoku makalindila zwinhu izwezwi, gwisani nemasimba ose kuti muwanike makatjena musina nlandu kakale muli mukunyalala naye. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Muzibe kuti ba nemoyonlefu kwaHe izila yetjidziwa. Ndizo bo naPhawuli gamu ledu linodikala wakamukwalila ehingisa butjenjebvu gwaakapiwa neNdzimu, <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />eleba ngekwa ikoku sekwaakakwala muwhalo dzidze dzose. Kuna zwimwe zwinhu mudzili zwinolema whisisika, kunoyeta kuti basina luzibo nebasakadzikama mukugalamoyo bazwileyanye, sekwabanothama mudzimwe whalo, bezwikokela paladziwa.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Ndizo ke imwi, badikani, saku mokuziba kale ikoku, mutjenjele musitungamiligwe ntome nematjinyo ebanhu basina nlayo mukobva mulahikigwa nedzikama kwenyu. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Koga kulani mungoni nemuziba He Ntjidzi wedu Yesu Khirisitu. Ngaakudziwe ngwenu kudza kunoti nekusingapele! Akujalo.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>